<title>FRANCE: EIB sets 700 mln Ffr loan for French Lyon metro.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 700 mln Ffr loan for French Lyon metro.</headline>
<dateline>LYON, France 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Investment Bank (EIB) has agreed a 108 million Ecu loan to fund an extension of the metro system and new stations in the French city of Lyon.</p>
<p>The EIB has in the last five years lent 5.6 billion Ecu on urban renewal projects, with three billion going on transport.</p>
</text>
